{
  "_comment": [
    "The Pestiféré's looks, put together by localTools/ascensionImport/importVisuals.py from the retail effects and",
    "sounds the Ascension client carries: retail Unholy and Blood Death Knight, the Necrolords, Uldir's G'huun and the",
    "generic decay and blood kits of Battle for Azeroth. Each look starts from the stock visual the spell had (its",
    "from) and replaces the slots given. localTools/pestifere/Looks.ps1 names a look by the id the import gives its",
    "key; mod-pestifere plays the kits (by their id) on the enemies and allies its scripts reach.",
    "Tank (Charnier): the festering strike and wound, Outbreak's contagion nova, bursting sores, a rotten stench, a",
    "bile spit, a tombstone, Fleshcraft's flesh shield, a decay pool, a breath of decay, Blighted Rune Weapon, the",
    "Apocalypse. Healer (Sangsue): blood plague and blood strike, a blood bolt, blood barriers, G'huun's blood.",
    "Kits: ContagionHit (each enemy a plague reaches), the healer's heals on each ally (Transfusion, Sangsue, Don de",
    "sang, Absorption morbide, Symbiote, Spores, Pustule, Essaim, Brume)."
  ],
